# Well-Engineering credentials file.
#
# Create the real file with scripts/init-secrets.sh.
# It is written to ~/.config/welleng/secrets.env with mode 600, outside any repository.
# Never commit the real file.
#
# Format: NAME=value, one per line, no spaces around "=", no "export", no quotes needed.
# Values are read on demand by the helpers that need them.
# They are NOT exported into every shell.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REQUIRED
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# None.
# Claude Code signs in with `claude`, then `/login`.
# GitHub signs in with `gh auth login`.
# Neither stores anything in this file.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# z.ai API key.
# Used by the `glm` shell function, which runs Claude Code against z.ai GLM models.
# Sessions started with `glm` cannot use Remote Control.
ZAI_API_KEY=

# Anthropic API key.
# Only for editor providers that use API keys, not for Claude Code itself.
# Do not export it from shell startup files, it can take precedence over your subscription login.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# OpenAI API key.
# Only for optional editor providers.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
